message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Mitsubishi Mini-Split Controller"
abstract: "Experimental, unofficial Python controller for Mitsubishi mini-split heat pumps on Kumo Cloud and the Mitsubishi Comfort app. An alternative to Auto mode: stays in heat, steers the setpoint from a 15-minute temperature prediction, cools only for solar gain, and logs every cycle to CSV."
type: software
authors:
